<span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">-</span><span style="color:#24292E"> GitHub: [</span><span style="color:#032F62;text-decoration:underline">mysite</span><span style="color:#24292E">](</span><span style="color:#24292E;text-decoration:underline">https://github.com/mysite</span><span style="color:#24292E">)</span></span>
<span class="line"></span></code></pre>
<h3 id="view-your-page" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#view-your-page">#</a> View Your Page</h3>
<p>Visit <code>http://localhost:4173/contact</code> to see your new page!</p>
<p>MarkoPress automatically:</p>
<ul>
<li>Created the route from the filename</li>
<li>Applied your site’s theme</li>
<li>Added navigation (if configured)</li>
<li>Generated proper HTML with SEO tags</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="step-4%3A-add-documentation" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#step-4%3A-add-documentation">#</a> Step 4: Add Documentation</h2>
<p>Create documentation with automatic sidebar navigation.</p>
<h3 id="create-a-doc-file" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#create-a-doc-file">#</a> Create a Doc File</h3>
